From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a slide runs no main frame per frame

The field trial testing config turns on
`CompositedAnimationsForceMainFrames` with `intersection-observer`. A
document with an intersection observation then runs a main frame and a
commit for every frame of a composited transform animation. Every
`<webview>` counts as one (`RemoteFrameView` always reports an active
observation), so each workspace slide redid the desk's paint on every
frame.

The study is dropped from the config. The rest of the config stays: a
build without it (`disable_fieldtrial_testing_config`) also lost the
experiments a desk benefits from.

Guarded by `guard-animation-main-frames.sh`.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 .../variations/fieldtrial_testing_config.json | 26 -------------------
 1 file changed, 26 deletions(-)

